          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Do you need help?",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "What is the real issue?",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I don't even know, because I am not happy",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Anxiety about losing my job",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I have been sad at times, but I listen to pleasant music.",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "When have you started feeling sad?",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I had fear of losing my job at times.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I suggest doing stress relieving tasks",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I can't think of that of now, because last three month a go pay cut and nest month payoff ",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Can you repeat that? You had a pay cut in the last three months?",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah and the company is planning layoff for some of the staffs",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "How do you know that layoffs are coming?",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Why not try to work for Uber or Lyft to supplement your income?",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
