          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "They sent circular to all staffs",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "What did it state? I am sorry to hear the news.",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Have you looked at updating your resume and looking on job boards?",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "No I think I will just do that now may be it will help",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "That is a great comment. Being pro-active and looking for similar jobs can help.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yeah thanks",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It' good to take initiative and start looking for other sources of income.",
