          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I believe it work if I try.",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I usually search job boards.  It is what I have dine in the past.",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "It is important to believe in yourself.",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I am thinking about uber",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p5",
          "reported_at": "2024-05-01",
          "session_id": "esc62",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can also suggest Lyft...",
